<td><font size="-1"><sup>*</sup> The <i>Cover</i> function returns the value of the second argument when the first argument equals the flag value (the NoData value defined in the metadata of the first file, if it is a raster). Otherwise, it returns the value of the first argument. In this way, the values of the second file are visible through the NoData areas of the first layer. As with other functions, either argument of the Cover function may be an intermediate result of other operations involving layers and scalar values.</font></td>
</tr>
